// The resonance array's tuned drums, and resin feedstock's reason to exist.
//
// Cheaper per shot than darts and slower to make, so a thrower is the
// answer to *many* things rather than to one hard thing — which is what
// keeps the second emplacement a different shape rather than an upgrade
// (`SYSTEMS.md` §5.3). Tone: these are acoustic machine parts, spun to
// send a low pulse across an approach band. Nothing here is ordnance.
#![enable(implicit_some)]
ItemDef(
    id: "item.resonator_drums",
    name: "Resonator drums",
    glyph: "◌",
    order: 42,
)
